#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:270
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In the above list, notice that some files have been commented out with a "
"hash (#) character."
msgstr ""
"Na lista acima, observe que alguns arquivos foram comentados com um "
"caractere cerquilha (#)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The extra-cmake-modules entry has been commented out because it was built "
"earlier in the <xref linkend=\"kde-prereq\"/>."
msgstr ""
"A entrada extra-cmake-modules foi comentada porque foi construída "
"anteriormente no <xref linkend=\"kde-prereq\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:282
#, fuzzy, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "This icon package is covered separately at <xref linkend=\"breeze-icons\"/>."
#| "  It is separate to allow users that need these icons but do not need the "
#| "full set of KF6 packages (e.g. <xref linkend=\"lxqt-post-install\"/>) to "
#| "more easily install them. However they are a required dependency for several"
#| " kf6 packages."
msgid ""
"This icon packages are covered separately at <xref linkend=\"breeze-"
"icons\"/> and <xref linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>.  They are separate to allow "
"users that need these icons but do not need the full set of KF6 packages "
"(e.g. <xref linkend=\"lxqt-post-install\"/>) to more easily install them. "
"However they are a required dependency for several kf6 packages."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote de ícones é abordado separadamente em <xref linkend=\"breeze-"
"icons\"/>. Ele está separado para permitir que usuários(as) que precisem "
"desses ícones, mas não precisem do conjunto completo de pacotes do KF6 (por "
"exemplo, <xref linkend=\"lxqt-post-install\"/>), os instalem mais "
"facilmente. No entanto, eles são uma dependência exigida para vários pacotes"
" do kf6."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:304
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of KDE Frameworks"
msgstr "Instalação do KDE Frameworks"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:311
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If installing in <filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename> and there is "
"an existing /opt/kf6 either as a regular directory or a symbolic link, it "
"should be reinitialized (as <systemitem class=\"username\"> "
"root</systemitem>):"
msgstr ""
"Se instalar em <filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename> e existir um "
"/opt/kf6 existente ou como um diretório regular ou como um link simbólico, "
"ele deveria ser reinicializado (como <systemitem class=\"username\"> "
"root</systemitem>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf6/kf6-frameworks.xml:317
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mv -v /opt/kf6 /opt/kf6.old                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755           $KF6_PREFIX/{etc,share} &amp;&amp;\n"
